on`).\\n3. `/dashboard` — adult home (protected via `requireAdult()` from `@/lib/session`).\\n   - PARENT: shows the **Kode Keluarga** (familyCode) prominently with instructions: child opens `/masuk`, enters Kode Keluarga, picks their avatar, enters their 4-digit PIN. Lists children with summary cards (total stars, score, level, rank, weekly learning time). Form \\\"Tambah Anak\\\": nickname (max 20 chars), avatar picker (`AVATARS` from `@/lib/constants`), grade 1–6 (`GRADES`), REQUIRED parental-consent checkbox (FR-AUTH-05; set `consentAt`), generates a 4-digit PIN with `randomPin()` (store only `bcrypt` hash in `pinHash`) and shows the PIN ONCE after creation. Multiple children per parent (FR-AUTH-04).\\n   - TEACHER: list of classes + \\\"Buat Kelas\\\" (name) generating unique `code` via `randomCode(6)`; teacher must tick a checkbox confirming they have parent/school permission.\\n4. `/dashboard/anak/[id]` — child detail (access check with `adultCanAccessChild(userId, childId)` from `@/lib/session`; 404 otherwise):\\n   - FR-DASH-01 summary: total stars, score, current level, rank, weekly learning time (sum of `Attempt.durationSec` in last 7 days).\\n   - FR-DASH-02 per-level/per-mission table: status, stars, attempts, hints used (from `Progress`).\\n   - FR-DASH-03 concept mastery for Sequencing / Looping / IF-ELSE with labels \\\"Sudah Paham\\\"/\\\"Sedang Belajar\\\"/\\\"Perlu Bantuan\\\"/\\\"Belum Mulai\\\" — use icon + text, not color only.\\n   - FR-DASH-04 activity chart: last 7 days and last 4 weeks (stars earned & missions attempted), implemented as accessible SVG/CSS bars (no chart library).\\n   - FR-DASH-07 Bibi chat history grouped by mission, with a simple topic summary (e.g. count of questions per mission + which hint levels were reached; flagged messages marked).\\n   - FR-DASH-08 settings (parent only, or teacher for class students where sensible): daily learning limit in minutes (null = no limit; options e.g. 15/30/45/60/none), reset PIN (shows