range`, `orange-700` (orange text), `cta`, `leaf`, `leaf-700`, `sky`, `berry`, `sun`, `ink`; utilities `btn-primary`, `btn-navy`, `btn-ghost`, `btn-leaf`, `card`, `chip`, `input`, `label`; fonts `font-display`/`font-sans`. `@/components/brand/Logo`, `@/components/brand/BibiMascot`.\\n- Next.js 16 notes: `params` and `searchParams` are Promises (`const { id } = await params`), `cookies()` is async. Don't use middleware/proxy; protect each page server-side.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n- Dashboard must be visually separated from the kids area (NFR-UX-07): put a shared layout at `src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx` with a calmer adult header (Logo, user name, role badge, logout). Put auth pages under `src/app/akun/`.\\n- RBAC everywhere (NFR-SC-03): every server action re-checks session + ownership. Never trust IDs from the client.\\n- Responsive, accessible (labels, ARIA, keyboard), WCAG AA contrast.\\n- Put reusable dashboard components in `src/components/dashboard/` and server actions in `src/app/akun/actions.ts` and `src/app/dashboard/actions.ts`. Data-loading helpers may go in `src/lib/dashboard.ts`.\\n- Do NOT create/edit files outside: `src/app/akun/**`, `src/app/dashboard/**`, `src/app/api/export/**`, `src/components/dashboard/**`, `src/lib/dashboard.ts`. Other agents are concurrently building `/` (landing), `/masuk`, `/peta`, `/misi` and `/api/bibi`, `/api/progress`.\\n\\n## Environment notes\\n- Windows + PowerShell. `npm`/`npx` are blocked by execution policy: use `npm.cmd` / `npx.cmd`. Filesystem is slow; commands may take minutes.\\n- Do NOT run `npm install`, `next dev`, `next build`, or Prisma migrations (I will run them). Dependencies may still be installing; once `node_modules/typescript` and `node_modules/.prisma/client` exist you may run `npx.cmd tsc --noEmit -p e:\\\\codekids` and only fix errors in your own files. If `@prisma/client` types are not generated yet, you may run `npx.cmd prisma generate` once.\\n\\nWhen done, reply with a concise summary of routes/